UPDATE companies SET description='Michigan Fiber Optic LLC operates from Holton, Michigan, serving businesses, communities, and homeowners across the state. The company''s team brings three decades of experience in fiber optic installation, splicing, and network design, though a specific founding year is not publicly disclosed.

The firm provides end-to-end fiber optic services, including design, cable placement, installation, splicing, termination, testing, and turn-up. Its technicians handle all fiber types—single mode, multimode, ribbon, and tube—in both inside and outside plant environments. The company also offers structured cabling solutions such as Cat5, Cat6, and Wi-Fi system deployment, positioning itself as a single-source provider for fiber projects of any scale.

Michigan Fiber Optic responds to emergency repair requests 24 hours a day, 365 days a year, restoring service after cable cuts or outages. Its OTDR testing capability pinpoints faults ranging from minor bends to complete breaks, enabling targeted repairs.

