UPDATE companies SET description='Mid State Welding LLC operates from Spearfish, South Dakota, where it was founded in 2020 by Rodney and Brooke Ross. The husband‑and‑wife team started the business after Rodney spent 13 years welding pipelines across the country and they saw a local need for a reliable, full‑service metal fabrication shop. The company remains family‑owned and is run day‑to‑day by the Rosses, with Rodney handling welding and field work while Brooke manages client relations and project coordination.

The shop provides custom metal fabrication including structural steel, pipe fencing, entryways, staircases, railings, decks, and bridges. Core processes cover MIG, TIG, and stick welding on carbon steel, stainless steel, and aluminum. Mid State Welding also operates mobile welding rigs that travel to job sites throughout the Black Hills, western South Dakota, and eastern Wyoming, offering on‑site equipment repair for farms, ranches, and commercial projects.

Customers include homeowners, general contractors, builders, and agricultural operators across the region. The firm regularly subcontracts on commercial construction projects and handles farm and ranch equipment repair and fence maintenance. Its certifications allow it to bid on state and federal contracts, and the team coordinates with an engineer to produce code‑compliant plans for decks and structural work.

The Rosses say they launched Mid State Welding to fill a gap for a trustworthy welding partner that could handle any project size while maintaining direct communication. Their stated values — professionalism, craftsmanship, trustworthiness, quality, and safety — guide every job, and they emphasize step‑by‑step visual updates so clients see progress from concept to completion.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom metal fabrication", "Structural steel fabrication", "Pipe fencing", "Entryway fabrication", "Staircase fabrication", "Railing fabrication", "Deck building", "Bridge fabrication", "Mobile welding (MIG, TIG, stick)", "On-site equipment repair", "Farm and ranch equipment repair", "Commercial subcontracting", "Welding repair", "Steel structure fabrication", "Engineering support for code compliance"], "industries": ["Commercial construction", "Residential construction", "Contractors", "Builders", "Farm and ranch", "Agriculture", "State and federal government projects"], "materials": ["Carbon steel", "Stainless steel", "Aluminum"], "equipment": ["Mobile welding rigs", "MIG welders", "TIG welders", "Stick welders"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Mobile welding rigs for on\u2011site service across the Black Hills, western South Dakota, and eastern Wyoming", "Family\u2011owned with founders directly involved in every project", "On\u2011site farm and ranch equipment repair", "Project visualization and step\u2011by\u2011step client updates"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2020 -> /about", "Family-owned -> /about", "Founders Rodney and Brooke Ross -> /about", "Location Spearfish, South Dakota -> /", "Certifications AWS D1.1 and ASME B31.3 -> /about, /services", "Mobile welding rigs for on-site service -> /services", "Materials: carbon steel, stainless steel, aluminum -> /services", "135 projects completed -> /about", "Service area: Black Hills, western SD, eastern WY -> /, /services", "Industries served: commercial, residential, contractors, builders, farm/ranch, state/federal -> /, /services", "Values: professionalism, craftsmanship, trustworthiness, quality, safety -> /about", "TV appearance on Building Outside the Lines -> /", "Engineering support for city codes -> /services", "On-site farm/ranch equipment repair -> /services", "Step-by-step client updates and visuals -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We are YOUR one-stop-shop for Metal Fabrication", "founded_year": "2020", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='mid-state-welding-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
