UPDATE companies SET description='Molding Products LLC was founded in 1978 in South Bend, Indiana, as an operating business of IP Corporation. The company began by supplying sheet molding composites (SMC) to the growing compression molding industry and has remained focused on custom-formulated molding compounds for diverse applications.

