d in South Bend, Indiana -> /capabilities", "ISO 9001:2015 and ISO 14001:2015 certified -> /capabilities", "Produces sheet molding composites (SMC) -> /", "Custom-formulated molding compounds -> /", "Industries served: aerospace, automotive, etc. -> /about", "Not a custom molder, strategic alliances -> /about", "Team members listed -> /about", "Prototype tooling and compounding at same facility -> /capabilities", "Programmable logic control system -> /capabilities", "Centrally located to minimize freight costs -> /capabilities", "Graphene-enhanced SMC partnership with NanoXplore -> /", "Access to resin technologies via Interplastic Corporation -> /capabilities"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Molding Products, LLC is a leader in the production of sheet molding composites (SMC) and other engineered thermoset materials.", "founded_year": "1978", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='molding-products' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='The company has been family-owned and operated for over 25 years, building its reputation on 100% U.S.-made products and labor. While a specific founding year is not disclosed, the business emphasizes its roots in American manufacturing and a philosophy of quality and integrity passed down through the family.

