UPDATE companies SET description='Mountain Mold & Die operates from Sevierville, Tennessee, providing plastic injection molding services to a range of industrial clients. The company does not disclose its founding year, ownership structure, or founders in the available materials, nor does it describe how the business began. Its facility houses a range of injection molding equipment calibrated for precision work.

The shop runs injection molding presses ranging from 35 to 250 tons, producing precision parts with finished dimensions held to a 0.02 mm tolerance. Materials processed include acetal, nylon, PVC, and TPE. The product lineup features job trays, stock survey caps, and custom survey caps, all manufactured in-house. The company describes its approach as streamlined solutions for complex manufacturing needs.

Customers come from surveying, ophthalmology, and general manufacturing sectors. It highlights expertise in diverse material applications as a key benefit.

