UPDATE companies SET description='National Molding, headquartered in Miami Lakes, Florida, was founded in 1982. The company began as an injection molding specialist and developed proprietary Hetero Cavity technology that remains central to its operations today.

The company produces over 3.5 billion parts annually using highly engineered resins. Its capabilities span precision injection molding, medical product molding, metal-to-plastic conversions, low-cost modular molding, pre- and post-molding services, design for manufacturability, tooling design and manufacturing, cleanroom molding, insert over molding, and a full-service tool room with CNC machining. Molding machines range from 40 to 300 tons, supported by automation and assembly equipment. National Molding operates plants in the United States, Canada, and China, and over 80 percent of its output relies on the in-house Hetero Cavity process.

The medical division, certified to ISO 13485 and FDA registered, serves healthcare, life science, dental, and diagnostic markets from an ISO Class 8 cleanroom. Commercial lines cover plumbing fixtures, telecommunications, appliances, irrigation, furniture, marine, and electrical products. The DuraflexUSA division supplies Berry Amendment–compliant buckles and fasteners to sporting goods, military, tactical, and pet-supply markets, while a separate line produces tactical body armor release systems for military and law enforcement.

National Molding differentiates itself through its proprietary Hetero Cavity injection molding technology, developed internally and used across the majority of its parts. The company also offers full consulting and rapid-response contract engineering services, and maintains ISO 9001, ISO 13485, and IATF 16949 certifications across its operations.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ISO 13485:2016','IATF 16949','FDA Registered (Medical Division)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Precision Injection Molding", "Medical Product Molding", "Metal to Plastic Conversions", "Low Cost Modular Molding", "Pre & Post Molding Services", "Design for Manufacturability (DFM) & Material Science", "Tooling Design & Manufacturing", "Quality & Inspection", "Cleanroom Molding (ISO Class 8)", "Insert Over Molding", "Full-Service Tool Room", "CNC Machining", "Injection Molding (40\u2013300 ton)", "Automation & Assembly", "Engineering Services", "Rapid Response Contract Engineering"], "industries": ["Automotive (Tier 1, Tier 2, OEM)", "Medical & Healthcare", "Life Sciences", "Dental", "Diagnostic", "Commercial (Plumbing, Telecommunications, Appliance, Irrigation, Furniture, Marine, Electrical)", "Military & Law Enforcement", "Sporting Goods", "Pet Supplies", "Tactical Body Armor"], "materials": ["Highly engineered resins"], "equipment": ["Injection Molding Machines (40\u2013300 ton)", "CNC Machining Centers", "Automation & Assembly Equipment"], "volume": "Over 3.5 billion parts annually", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Proprietary Hetero Cavity injection molding technology developed in-house", "Over 80% of products manufactured using Hetero Cavity process", "Global manufacturing footprint with plants in the U.S., Canada, and China", "ISO Class 8 cleanroom for medical device assembly", "Berry Amendment and Buy America Act compliant production"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1982 -> db", "Headquartered in Miami Lakes, Florida -> db", "Produces over 3.5 billion parts p