UPDATE companies SET description='Based in the Maker''s District of Bend, Oregon, Natural Edge Furniture builds custom furniture from premium wood slabs salvaged from the Pacific Northwest. The company operates as Natural Edge Furniture & Supply, offering both finished pieces and a slab inventory for customer projects.

The shop specializes in large dining and conference tables, desks, occasional tables, and benches. Expert craftsmen assist with design and wood-species recommendations, milling and finishing slabs such as walnut, blue pine, African sapele, white oak, madrone, hickory, elm, and fumed white oak. The facility also maintains a stock of live-edge slabs for direct purchase.

Customers include residential buyers seeking one-of-a-kind tables and benches, as well as commercial clients needing conference tables and office furniture.

