UPDATE companies SET description='Nebraska Prep Equipment is based in Adams, Nebraska. The company was founded in late 2017 by Cory Hart and Jamison Wallman. While building a catering kitchen for their own catering business, the pair struggled to find quality used equipment locally. They expanded their search to larger Midwestern cities, began transporting equipment back to southeast Nebraska, cleaning it, and reselling it to other food service operators.

The business operates as a food service equipment supplier, offering both used and new equipment. New equipment carries manufacturer warranties, and the company also sells scratch-and-dent units at a discount. A showroom in Adams operates by appointment only.

The company serves locally owned food and hospitality businesses, including restaurants, caterers, and other food service operators in the region.

