UPDATE companies SET description='Ness Electronics, Inc. is based in Burnsville, Minnesota, and operates from a facility in Mendota Heights after becoming part of Industry Tech Sales. In a recent transition, the company relocated to East, Suite 200, in Mendota Heights, Minnesota, and now functions under the Industry Tech Sales umbrella.

